stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> created
  created --> queued
  queued --> active
  active --> answered: valid response in time
  active --> expired: deadline reached
  active --> cancelled: duplicate/superseded
  answered --> [*]
  expired --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  note right of active
    Delivery attempts and customer subscribers are separate.
    Push accepted is not device received.
  end note
